          "ForeName": "E V",
          "LastName": "Denesiuk",
          "Initials": "EV"
        }
      },
      "ArticleTitle": "[THE EFFECTIVENESS OF THE CORRECTION OF ENDOTHELIAL DYSFUNCTION AND REMODELING OF THE BRACHIAL ARTERY WITH CONCENTRIC AND ECCENTRIC LEFT VENTRICULAR HYPERTROPHY IN PATIENTS WITH UNSTABLE ANGINA WITH COMORBID HYPERTENSION].",
